{"id":"001a554b14f163b9","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Seq Choice Sequence","display":"df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence — ZFC Seq Choice Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence — ZFC Seq Choice Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence — ZFC Seq Choice Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" href=\"?note=9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,F,I,U\\in V\">\\(s,F,I,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqChoiceSequence}_S(s,F,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqChoiceSequence}_S(s,F,I)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}choice\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqChoiceSequence}_S(s,F,I)\\leftrightarrow \\exists U\\;\\Bigl(U=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,\\mathcal P(U)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,I,U)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(i)\\in F(i))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}choice\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqChoiceSequence}_S(s,F,I)\\leftrightarrow \\exists U\\;\\Bigl(U=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,\\mathcal P(U)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,I,U)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(i)\\in F(i))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both the indexed family and the selecting sequence are functions, and every indexed set is required to be nonempty. This remains an indexed choice sequence even when the same set occurs at different indices.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a8f01bfcbcdc014","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,F,I,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqChoiceSequence}_S(s,F,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}choice\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqChoiceSequence}_S(s,F,I)\\leftrightarrow \\exists U\\;\\Bigl(U=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,\\mathcal P(U)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,I,U)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(i)\\in F(i))\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1097,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3340","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-seq-choice-sequence]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["9a8f01bfcbcdc014","36d7463d215be751","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}